    "updated_at": "2026-11-19T12:12:03Z",
    "body": "Thank you, @vilts - confirmed and bisected.\n\nTriage: `bug`, `P2` (a gate on main is red), `effort:high` (the cause is in the fig8 geometry/containment path, under the safety floor), `area:ui`, `area:2d`.\n\nReadings on Linux (Ryzen 9 5950X, Ubuntu 26.04, `xvfb-run cargo test -p camcraft-ui --lib -- frame_cost`):\n\n| main commit | result |\n|---|---|\n| 248b3ac45 (merge of #2747) | 8 passed |\n| add5aaa90 (merge of #2728) | 8 passed |\n| 6df70dfc5 (merge of #2760, #2754) | **4 failed**, same assert `frame_cost_probe.rs:278` \"the area preview is filled\" |\n\nSo the first bad merge is #2760 (step boundary split for #2754). It fixed `shoulder_adaptive` on the fig8 Outside case, and the same change leaves `boundary_viz::preview_fill` with `None` for `adaptive_preview`'s fig8 Outside patch. The fix belongs with #2760's author; this is not related to the PR for #2608.\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
    "pin": null,
